3,"y":0.67005813948061332,"text":"3"},{"h":0.01191526919682262,"text":"Europe's largest","x":0.11934156337176879,"w":0.12139917373657227,"y":0.66990291253278378},{"text":"is actually in South","y":0.67151162797548936,"h":0.01163047283808949,"w":0.13168724060058595,"x":0.34773662441850001},{"text":"America in French-owned Guiana! It is home to over","x":0.12962964671505262,"h":0.01191526919682262,"w":0.36213989257812501,"y":0.68446601962582609},{"w":0.32098766326904293,"h":0.011915269196822509,"y":0.69902912603460443,"x":0.12757200797453211,"text":"1,000 animal species and 5,625 types of plant."},{"w":0.30681135177612306,"text":"4 Mauna Loa, Hawaii, is the world's largest","h":0.014789303529609832,"y":0.71214578121723926,"x":0.1027573478103487},{"y":0.72815533993306281,"x":0.2325102938297684,"w":0.2304526710510254,"h":0.011670241393773595,"text":"- it's also one of the most active."},{"x":0.12757202972920298,"w":0.29218105316162113,"text":"There have been 33 eruptions since 1843.","y":0.74127906988440395,"h":0.01162790683971926},{"h":0.010293724888315925,"w":0.053497939109802245,"y":0.75581395398093332,"x":0.10288066082918665,"text":"5 The"},{"w":0.22427982330322266,"text":"_of Machu Picchu are one of the","y":0.75581395352054725,"x":0.25720165493789482,"h":0.01162790683971926},{"x":0.12551440042712478,"text":"most famous historical places in the world.","w":0.29423868179321289,"h":0.013239187996469615,"y":0.76875551646265861},{"y":0.78318569527398241,"h":0.012116981836303831,"text":"6 If you like","w":0.090658512115478526,"x":0.10281889204054469},{"x":0.29218107625426826,"h":0.011674090180897823,"text":"_, you should visit the","w":0.15637859344482419,"y":0.78488372095029546},{"x":0.12551439936897693,"h":0.01191526919682262,"w":0.37037036895751951,"y":0.79788173006456464,"text":"Maldives where you can swim in some of the clearest"},{"text":"waters on Earth.","x":0.12551440726330909,"w":0.1111111068725586,"y":0.81244483659458155,"h":0.010229581662857257},{"text":"7 Postojna is a famous","w":0.16666666030883787,"x":0.10082304677973745,"h":0.01162790683971926,"y":0.82558139547548914},{"h":0.011822777097454495,"text":"_in Slovenia.","w":0.090584812164306638,"x":0.3682878395291142,"y":0.82693744885717835},{"h":0.011627906839719149,"y":0.84156976753944268,"text":"Actually, it's a 24,340-metre long system of","x":0.12551440458644036,"w":0.29835390090942382},{"text":"underground rooms full of stalactites and stalagmites.","y":0.85465116308010336,"x":0.12345678797984191,"h":0.013081394879037367,"w":0.37242797851562504},{"text":"8 If we say Australia is a continent, Greenland is","x":0.10082306311610335,"y":0.86918604654380316,"w":0.34156375885009771,"h":0.011661261451633598},{"x":0.12345679507438376,"text":"actually the biggest","y":0.88372093021386122,"h":0.011689484487669932,"w":0.13991768836975096},{"h":0.013000049321712503,"text":"9 Aphrodite","y":0.89611625414300344,"w":0.094969205856323249,"x":0.10066354640497917},{"w":0.19547325134277344,"h":0.01191526919682262,"text":"_,located near the coast of","y":0.8967343334435266,"x":0.26131687525453912},{"w":0.37242797851562504,"text":"Cyprus, marks the place where Aphrodite, the goddess","x":0.12345679729054133,"h":0.013239187996469504,"y":0.91129744046983596},{"y":0.9227714031312545,"w":0.35802467346191408,"h":0.0147285966460724,"text":"of love, beauty, procreation, and pleasure, was born.","x":0.12345679337878251},{"x":0.53703703861002594,"y":0.047965116774070338,"w":0.34567901611328122,"text":"VOCABULARY PRACTICE | Describing places","h":0.016024291567958149},{"text":"5 Look at the vocabulary in lesson 4.4 in the Students' Book","y":0.068313953854086007,"h":0.013081394879037256,"w":0.41152263641357423,"x":0.53909464825411835},{"text":"Match the sentence halves. There is one extra ending.","x":0.5616271201118278,"y":0.082575080885929686,"w":0.36235927581787108,"h":0.013439407415970828},{"text":"Calico in California is an old mining","y":0.098889553834166977,"h":0.014611126360173587,"x":0.58414410052782784,"w":0.24536035537719725},{"text":"1 I really don't like such hot","x":0.55967078641096213,"y":0.11606354804225161,"w":0.20370368957519525,"h":0.013296916857296059},{"x":0.55967078710365226,"h":0.011627906839719149,"y":0.13226744212277608,"w":0.18724279403686528,"text":"2 There are a lot of traffic"},{"w":0.25925926208496086,"x":0.55967078372089407,"y":0.14825581425830725,"h":0.010174417958676241,"text":"3 Good bars and restaurants attract"},{"text":"4 Guangzhou is one of the main trading","x":0.55967078957390581,"y":0.16416593133509572,"h":0.013239187996469504,"w":0.28600822448730467},{"x":0.55967078273767801,"h":0.013239187996469504,"y":0.17872903791764361,"w":0.20987653732299805,"text":"5 There are plenty of historic"},{"text":"6 The main terrace in Parc Güell offers","y":0.19622093009107844,"h":0.010310402825566833,"w":0.27572015762329105,"x":0.55967078814308691},{"h":0.015133622044077644,"text":"some of the most breathtaking","x":0.58008126058925025,"w":0.21651416778564458,"y":0.20739626284052548},{"y":0.23830538395284073,"w":0.13991768836975094,"h":0.010241127182505139,"x":0.57818930279729186,"text":"and humid weather."},{"text":"b monuments worth seeing in Venice, not just Saint","w":0.36625514984130858,"y":0.25419240952102151,"x":0.5576131612418973,"h":0.013249450727363388},{"text":"Mark's Square.","h":0.01191526919682262,"w":0.1028806591033935,"y":0.26875551646584472,"x":0.58024691496133474},{"w":0.19958847045898442,"text":"c visitors to the city centre.","x":0.55761317550438971,"y":0.28488372099874504,"h":0.011674090180897823},{"y":0.2992056487033351,"text":"d village next to the sea.","x":0.55761317390622311,"w":0.18106994628906248,"h":0.013294351279788175},{"text":"e jams in my city.","x":0.55761316931415061,"h":0.011630472417227145,"y":0.31685789957821386,"w":0.12962963104248049},{"y":0.33139534890572175,"w":0.23662549972534186,"h":0.011627906839719149,"text":"views in the whole of Barcelona.","x":0.56584362479439376},{"y":0.34730803183277614,"text":"g centres in China.","x":0.55555555851049854,"h":0.01191526919682262,"w":0.14197530746459963},{"h":0.010174417958676241,"y":0.3619186048045766,"w":0.014403291940689122,"x":0.55555555550427826,"text":"h"},{"w":0.35596706390380861,"x":0.56790123577786278,"text":"and ghost town where some buildings come from","h":0.013258430669503385,"y":0.3631950574919145},{"h":0.010323230713106146,"y":0.37775816429457498,"x":0.57818930140241465,"text":"the 1880s.","w":0.076131687164306627},{"y":0.40114739624942275,"w":0.24279834747314455,"x":0.5329218163457321,"h":0.010189813107173151,"text":"WORD STORE 4E | Collocations"},{"x":0.53086420309823357,"text":"6 Look at the vocabulary in lesson 4.4 in the Students'","w":0.40534976959228508,"h":0.013239187996469615,"y":0.42144748451978042},{"y":0.43601059150699717,"text":"Book. Complete the collocations in the sentences.","w":0.36213989257812507,"h":0.011663827029141594,"x":0.55555557264097855},{"h":0.013239187996469504,"y":0.45057369817300619,"x":0.55349794550142006,"text":"The first and last letters are given.","w":0.25102880477905276},{"x":0.57818931017282738,"text":"The ancient city of Troy, once a great and beautiful","h":0.013081394879037367,"y":0.46802325595801042,"w":0.35390945434570309},{"x":0.57613169273274734,"y":0.48234774916467837,"h":0.01191526919682262,"w":0.26337448120117191,"text":"place, is now just a load of old stones."},{"x":0.55349794353821891,"y":0.49854651150262108,"w":0.15637859344482419,"h":0.01162790683971926,"text":"1 The Daintree is a d"},{"h":0.010174418379538697,"x":0.76337448780121353,"y":0.49999999987790011,"text":"e rainforest in the","w":0.13580246925354},{"x":0.57613169165292732,"w":0.37037036895751951,"h":0.013081394879037256,"y":0.5130813955110628,"text":"north-east of Australia. Some experts believe it is 180"},{"x":0.57613168784895519,"h":0.013081394879037256,"text":"million years old, so much older than the Amazon","w":0.34362140655517581,"y":0.52761627925016152},{"h":0.010174417958676241,"w":0.07407407283782963,"y":0.5421511631379099,"x":0.57407407592676418,"text":"rainforest."},{"x":0.5514403322677297,"h":0.011644583935245256,"text":"2 There are plenty of h","w":0.17489711761474613,"y":0.55957634615612606},{"w":0.022633743286132768,"x":0.79012345733498568,"h":0.0087209299193582446,"y":0.56104651163915809,"text":"ts"},{"y":0.5625000003019488,"w":0.028806583881378134,"text":"s in","x":0.87448559681102556,"h":0.0087209299193582446},{"h":0.013081394879037256,"y":0.5726744186215279,"text":"Europe, but the most famous is probably the Blue","w":0.34362140655517581,"x":0.57613168290211036},{"w":0.34773662567138663,"h":0.011627906839719149,"y":0.5886627907080475,"x":0.57407407747294859,"text":"Lagoon in Iceland. The water temperature there is"},{"w":0.065937485694885223,"y":0.60161035518917483,"x":0.57196952958082348,"text":"37-39°C.","h":0.011895568625440833},{"text":"3 Cantabria in northern Spain is famous for its","x":0.55144033424951377,"w":0.32716049194335939,"h":0.013239187996469615,"y":0.61915269208010759},{"h":0.013239187996469504,"text":"h vegetation. It has a very wet climate and","w":0.29629629135131841,"y":0.63371579886735518,"x":0.64403291934491702},{"text":"is part of a larger area that people call 'Green Spain'.","w":0.37037036895751951,"y":0.64680232634892498,"h":0.016039685874730147,"x":0.57201646258914152},{"y":0.6641832746552383,"x":0.54721178249206504,"w":0.37059581756591797,"text":"4 Mount Tambora in Indonesia is the world's largest","h":0.014778672544070282},{"x":0.57201646282251306,"y":0.68005295687002132,"w":0.072016458511352521,"h":0.0089005312873321474,"text":"volcanic c"},{"y":0.68005295661918008,"h":0.01035401974751271,"text":"r. It is 4.36 miles wide and 1 mile","x":0.70781893484485747,"w":0.2304526710510254},{"h":0.01162790683971926,"y":0.6933139536053341,"x":0.57201646117604998,"text":"deep","w":0.039094648361206019},{"h":0.010174417958676241,"w":0.010288065671920865,"text":"5","y":0.71075581444604952,"x":0.54938271623811363},{"x":0.56172840335575325,"y":0.71075581416416356,"w":0.36419750213623048,"h":0.013081394879037256,"text":"The Lut Desert in Iran is the hottest place on Earth."},{"text":"Because of the s","y":0.72529069805191182,"w":0.11522633552551265,"x":0.57201646042654408,"h":0.010366848476776935},{"y":0.72674418621192338,"x":0.753086421925239,"text":"g temperatures, there is","w":0.16872426986694344,"h":0.011627906839719149},{"text":"very little life in the area.","w":0.17489711761474613,"h":0.013239187996469504,"y":0.73830538381630362,"x":0.56995884829139243},{"h":0.010174418800401153,"x":0.54526748968809169,"w":0.014403291940689122,"y":0.75726744183526451,"text":"6"},{"y":0.75726744212894681,"x":0.56378600955563296,"w":0.034979422092437762,"h":0.01017441795867613,"text":"An"},{"text":"ct","h":0.010174417958676241,"x":0.65637860126918757,"y":0.75726744201387897,"w":0.028806583881378134},{"text":"e is a group of people that","h":0.018701078611880639,"w":0.19412334442138679,"x":0.74457839567871953,"y":0.75346001105413796},{"x":0.56995885885497044,"y":0.77034883722617908,"w":0.36213989257812507,"text":"are always moving. Examples are the Bedouin in the","h":0.013081394879037256},{"y":0.7848837209696754,"text":"Middle East and the Cherokee Native Americans.","x":0.5720164760741685,"w":0.33950614929199219,"h":0.011674090180897823},{"y":0.95203488371676848,"text":"51","w":0.024691357612609877,"x":0.90534979465048504,"h":0.011627906839719149}]